  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, all creatures take 6d12 lightning damage. Any Disaster Storms technique you use within your domain targets all creatures within your domain.</p>",
